## 12. Final Principle

- QUANDA should treat AI models as tools inside a project pipeline, not as the project pipeline itself.
- A coding agent, local model, hosted API, documentation page, tutorial, plugin, template, or manual workflow are competing execution methods.
- Model choice should reduce total project friction, not add fashionable complexity.
- The recommended AI path must be explainable against alternatives and grounded in the user's actual constraints, access, skill, hardware, budget, privacy needs, and deadline.
